{"id":"n2-032","title":"Noun を めぐって","romaji":"Noun wo megutte","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Concerning; with regard to; about","longExplanation":"The grammar point Noun を めぐって is used to express that something is concerning, with regard to or about a certain noun. It covers a topic or an issue that is central to a discussion or a situation.","formation":"Noun + を + めぐって","examples":[{"jp":"環境問題をめぐって、多くの議論が行われています。","romaji":"Kankyō mondai o megutte, ōku no giron ga okonawarete imasu.","en":"Many discussions are held concerning environmental issues.","words":[{"surface":"環境","vocabId":"1213280","reading":"かんきょう"},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"をめぐって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多く","vocabId":"1861770","reading":"おおく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"議論","vocabId":"1226160","reading":"ぎろん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行わ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなう","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"彼の死をめぐって、いくつかの陰謀説が浮かび上がっている。","romaji":"Kare no shi o megutte, ikutsuka no inbōsetsu ga ukabiagatte iru.","en":"Several conspiracy theories have emerged regarding his death.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"死","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"をめぐって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いくつ","vocabId":"1219960","reading":"いくつ"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"陰謀","vocabId":"1170500","reading":"いんぼう"},{"surface":"説","vocabId":"1386370","reading":"せつ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"浮かび上がっ","vocabId":"1497350","reading":"うかびあがる","baseForm":"浮かび上がる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"昇給をめぐって会社と労働組合が話し合いをしています。","romaji":"Shōkyū o megutte kaisha to rōdō kumiai ga hanashiai o shite imasu.","en":"The company and the labor union are having discussions about pay raises.","words":[{"surface":"昇給","vocabId":"1349760","reading":"しょうきゅう"},{"surface":"をめぐって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会社","vocabId":"1198550","reading":"かいしゃ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"労働","vocabId":"1606450","reading":"ろうどう"},{"surface":"組合","vocabId":"1397620","reading":"くみあい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話し合い","vocabId":"1600910","reading":"はなしあい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,8]},{"jp":"この映画をめぐって、賛否両論が存在している。","romaji":"Kono eiga o megutte, sanpi ryōron ga sonzai shite iru.","en":"There are both pros and cons regarding this movie.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"をめぐって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"賛否","vocabId":"1304220","reading":"さんぴ"},{"surface":"両論","vocabId":"1554140","reading":"りょうろん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"存在","vocabId":"1406150","reading":"そんざい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]}]}